{"id":33688,"date":"2024-12-19T08:52:08","date_gmt":"2024-12-19T08:52:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/edusmart.physcode.com\/demo-main\/?p=33688"},"modified":"2026-08-30T12:37:56","modified_gmt":"2026-08-30T12:37:56","slug":"ailelerin-sinav-surecinde-cocuklarina-yaklasimi-nasil-olmali","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/ailelerin-sinav-surecinde-cocuklarina-yaklasimi-nasil-olmali\/","title":{"rendered":"Ailelerin S\u0131nav S\u00fcrecinde \u00c7ocuklar\u0131na Yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 Nas\u0131l Olmal\u0131?"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"33688\" class=\"elementor elementor-33688\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-500476d0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"500476d0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-648bdbb1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"648bdbb1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00dcniversiteye haz\u0131rl\u0131k s\u00fcreci sadece \u00f6\u011frenciler i\u00e7in de\u011fil, aileler i\u00e7in de yo\u011fun duygu ve sorumluluklarla dolu bir d\u00f6nemdir. Bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te ebeveynlerin tutum ve yakla\u015f\u0131mlar\u0131, \u00f6\u011frencinin motivasyonunu, \u00f6zg\u00fcvenini ve stresle ba\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kma becerisini do\u011frudan etkiler. S\u0131nav s\u00fcrecinde \u00e7ocu\u011fa yakla\u015f\u0131m, \u00f6\u011frencinin akademik ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131 kadar psikolojik iyi olu\u015funu da do\u011frudan etkiler. Murat E\u011fitim Gaziosmanpa\u015fa olarak, ailelerle \u00f6\u011frenciler aras\u0131ndaki bu kritik k\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc sa\u011flam k\u0131lacak \u00f6nerileri a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da aktar\u0131yoruz.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>1. S\u0131nav S\u00fcrecinde \u00c7ocu\u011fa Do\u011fru Yakla\u015f\u0131m Nas\u0131l Olmal\u0131?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\u00d6\u011frenciler s\u0131nav s\u00fcrecinde s\u0131k\u00e7a kayg\u0131, korku, umutsuzluk gibi duygular ya\u015farlar. Bu duygular\u0131 \u201c\u00f6fke\u201d, \u201c\u015fikayet\u201d ya da \u201ctembellik\u201d gibi etiketlerle k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fcmsemek yerine, etkili bir dinleyici olun.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\u201cSeni anl\u0131yorum, bu s\u00fcre\u00e7 zorlay\u0131c\u0131\u201d gibi ifadelerle duygular\u0131n\u0131 kabul etti\u011finizi g\u00f6sterin. Bu yakla\u015f\u0131m, \u00f6\u011frencide yaln\u0131z olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 hissettirir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Konu\u015fmay\u0131 onlar\u0131n duygular\u0131ndan ba\u015flat\u0131n: \u201cBug\u00fcn nas\u0131ls\u0131n?\u201d, \u201c\u015eu an en b\u00fcy\u00fck endi\u015fen ne?\u201d gibi sorularla duygular\u0131n\u0131 ifade etmeye te\u015fvik edin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>2. Bask\u0131dan Uzak, Destekleyici Bir Tutum Benimseyin<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\u201cBa\u015far\u0131l\u0131 olamazsan \u00fcz\u00fcl\u00fcr\u00fcz\u201d ya da \u201cSenin y\u00fcz\u00fcnden\u2026\u201d gibi y\u00fckleyici ifadelerden ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131n. A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 bask\u0131, s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131rma riski ta\u015f\u0131r.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Hedef odakl\u0131 de\u011fil, \u00e7aba odakl\u0131 bir dil kullan\u0131n: \u201c\u00c7ok \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsun; emeklerin k\u0131ymetli\u201d gibi olumlu peki\u015ftirmeler hem moral verir hem de \u00f6\u011frenciye g\u00fcven a\u015f\u0131lar.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Sonu\u00e7tan \u00f6nce s\u00fcre\u00e7leri vurgulay\u0131n; her s\u0131nav bir geli\u015fim basama\u011f\u0131d\u0131r, hatalar \u00f6\u011frenmenin par\u00e7as\u0131d\u0131r.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>3. Beklentileri Ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i Tutun<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Her \u00f6\u011frenci farkl\u0131d\u0131r; g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc y\u00f6nleri, ilgi alanlar\u0131, \u00f6\u011frenme h\u0131z\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fkenlik g\u00f6sterir. Beklentilerinizi \u00e7ocu\u011fun kapasitesine ve geli\u015fim s\u00fcrecine g\u00f6re \u015fekillendirin.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Beklentiler y\u00fcksek olmal\u0131; ama ula\u015f\u0131lamaz olmamal\u0131. Ula\u015f\u0131lmas\u0131 g\u00fc\u00e7 hedefler, daha fazla stres yaratabilir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>K\u0131yaslamadan ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131n \u2014 ba\u015fka \u00f6\u011frencilerle kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmalar benlik alg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 zedeleyebilir.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>4. D\u00fczenli Ya\u015fam, Beslenme ve Uyku Deste\u011fi<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>S\u0131nav s\u00fcrecinde verimli \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma kadar <strong>d\u00fczenli uyku<\/strong> ve <strong>sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 beslenme<\/strong> de \u00e7ok \u00f6nemlidir. Zihnin iyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fabilmesi i\u00e7in bedenin deste\u011fe ihtiya\u00e7 vard\u0131r.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 kafein, d\u00fczensiz \u00f6\u011f\u00fcnler, ge\u00e7 kalkmalarin olumsuz etkisi b\u00fcy\u00fck olabilir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Fiziksel aktivite, k\u0131sa y\u00fcr\u00fcy\u00fc\u015fler, a\u00e7\u0131k hava molalar\u0131 hem stresi azalt\u0131r hem dikkat tazeler.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>5. Zaman Y\u00f6netimi ve Dinlenme Dengelemesi<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\u00c7ocu\u011funuzla birlikte dengeli bir \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma plan\u0131 olu\u015fturun: \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma-dinlenme molalar\u0131 dengeli olmal\u0131.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Molalarda rahatlama teknikleri \u00f6nerin: k\u0131sa meditasyon, nefes egzersizleri, hafif fiziksel hareketler gibi y\u00f6ntemlerle zihni tazelemek faydal\u0131d\u0131r.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Molas\u0131z \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmak, t\u00fckenmi\u015flik riskini art\u0131r\u0131r.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>6. S\u0131nav\u0131 Ama\u00e7tan \u00c7\u0131karmay\u0131n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>S\u0131nav, bir de\u011ferlendirme arac\u0131d\u0131r; hayat\u0131n tamam\u0131 de\u011fil. Bu ger\u00e7e\u011fi \u00e7ocuklar\u0131n\u0131za hat\u0131rlat\u0131n.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131k \u201cson\u201d de\u011fil, bir \u00f6\u011frenme f\u0131rsat\u0131d\u0131r. Hatalardan ders \u00e7\u0131karabilme becerisi uzun vadede \u00e7ok de\u011ferlidir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\u201cNe olursa olsun yan\u0131nda olaca\u011f\u0131z\u201d mesaj\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131k\u00e7a yineleyin \u00e7ocuk, sevildi\u011fini ve desteklendi\u011fini hissetmelidir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>7. Gerekti\u011finde Profesyonel Destek ve Rehberlik<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>E\u011fer s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131 a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 d\u00fczeydeyse, dikkat da\u011f\u0131n\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131, uyku sorunlar\u0131 ya da s\u00fcrekli moral d\u00fc\u015f\u00fckl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc varsa bir rehber \u00f6\u011fretmen, psikolojik dan\u0131\u015fman ya da uzman deste\u011fi al\u0131nmas\u0131 de\u011ferlidir.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Aileler de bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te kendi kayg\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 kontrol etmelidir; ailelerin kayg\u0131s\u0131, \u00e7ocuklara bula\u015fabilir.\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\u00a0\n<ul>\n<li>\u00d6\u011frencinizin kayg\u0131yla ba\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olacak pratik teknikler i\u00e7in [S\u0131nav Kayg\u0131s\u0131yla Ba\u015f Etmenin Etkili Yollar\u0131](<a href=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/sinav-kaygisiyla-bas-etme-yollari-yks-ogrencileri-icin\/\">https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/sinav-kaygisiyla-bas-etme-yollari-yks-ogrencileri-icin\/<\/a>) yaz\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 da inceleyebilirsiniz.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><\/p>\n<h3><strong>Murat E\u011fitim Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Kalitesi<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 Gaziosmanpa\u015fa olarak, yaln\u0131zca akademik destek sa\u011flamakla kalm\u0131yor; aile \u00f6\u011frenci aras\u0131ndaki ileti\u015fimi g\u00fc\u00e7lendiren bir anlay\u0131\u015fla da yan\u0131n\u0131zday\u0131z. Rehber \u00f6\u011fretmen kadromuz, psikolojik dan\u0131\u015fma destek birimimiz ve veli bilgilendirme programlar\u0131m\u0131zla, \u00f6\u011frencinizin s\u0131nav yolculu\u011funda <strong>hem bilgi hem ruh sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131<\/strong> a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan en do\u011fru deste\u011fi ama\u00e7l\u0131yoruz.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Siz de\u011ferli aileler, bu s\u00fcrecin e\u015flik\u00e7isi ve en g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc dayana\u011f\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z. Do\u011fru yakla\u015f\u0131m, sevgi ve sab\u0131rla birlikte, \u00e7ocuklar\u0131m\u0131z s\u0131nav yolculu\u011funun en verimli halini ya\u015fayacaklard\u0131r.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u00dcniversiteye haz\u0131rl\u0131k s\u00fcreci sadece \u00f6\u011frenciler i\u00e7in de\u011fil, aileler i\u00e7in de yo\u011fun duygu ve sorumluluklarla dolu bir d\u00f6nemdir. Bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te ebeveynlerin tutum ve yakla\u015f\u0131mlar\u0131, \u00f6\u011frencinin motivasyonunu, \u00f6zg\u00fcvenini ve&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":35575,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[16],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-33688","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ogrenci-rehberligi"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Ailelerin S\u0131nav S\u00fcrecinde \u00c7ocuklar\u0131na Yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 Nas\u0131l Olmal\u0131? - Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat E\u011fitim<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"S\u0131